Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,THE AI TRIED TO APPROVE ITS OWN REFUND.\NTHE KERNEL SAID NO.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,HERE'S WHY IT CAN'T.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,LAYER 1 - NEMOTRON (NVIDIA). REQUESTS ONLY.\NLAYER 2 - CUSTODIAN KERNEL. DECIDES WHAT HAPPENS.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,THE MODEL CAN ONLY REQUEST.\NTHE KERNEL CANNOT BE OVERRIDDEN.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[1/8] EARN - NO BAND, NO CAP, NO APPROVAL.\NRECEIVING MONEY IS ASYMMETRICALLY UNRESTRICTED.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[2/8] AUTONOMOUS SPEND - WITHIN BAND.\NKERNEL CLEARS. NO HUMAN. PI ON SCREEN.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[3/8] OVER BAND - KERNEL ESCALATES.\NREAL TWILIO SMS HEADED FOR THE OPERATOR'S PHONE.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,CODE ARRIVED ON TWILIO + OPERATOR PHONE ONLY.\NNOTHING IN THE AGENT'S PROCESS CAN SEE IT.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.00,0:00:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[4/8] HUMAN APPROVES.\N$3,500 EXECUTED. STRIPE PI RECORDED.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[5/8] $40 - NORMALLY FINE. KERNEL SAYS NO.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.00,0:01:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[7/8] REFUND ALWAYS ESCALATES. SECOND SMS.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,THE MODEL CAN BE LIED TO.\NTHE KERNEL CANNOT.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.00,0:01:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[PROOF B] REAL MODAL GPU CYCLE. SAME KERNEL.\NDETERMINISTIC AUDIT TRAIL. NO ONE CAN FAKE IT.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.00,0:01:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[1/4] WE INJECT THE BUG.\NTHE TEST CATCHES IT. THE FILE IS RESTORED.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.00,0:01:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,1,245 TESTS. INCLUDES test_spend_v2_has_no_approved_by_flag -\NTHE REGRESSION THAT REINTRODUCES THE SELF-APPROVAL BUG.
